{"sha": "d230af1366558fd6b78b57f67d452162ee2b730bd01343c3417776c8eca30e71", "body": ["\\begin{solution}{exo:b2:genfun:12}", "设 $A$ 与 $B$ 分别为从", "“当前无正面”与“当前有一个正面”出发的剩余时长的母函数。", "掷一次耗去一步，于是：从状态 $0$ 出发，", "反面回到状态 $0$，正面转入状态 $1$；从状态", "$1$ 出发，正面结束游戏，反面回到状态 $0$：", "\\[", "A(t) = t\\bigl(q\\,A(t) + p\\,B(t)\\bigr),", "\\qquad", "B(t) = t\\bigl(p + q\\,A(t)\\bigr).", "\\]", "代入得 $A(1 - qt) = pt\\,B = pt(pt + qtA)$，于是", "\\[", "G_T(t) = A(t) = \\frac{p^2t^2}{1 - qt - pq\\,t^2} .", "\\]", "当 $t = 1$ 时，分母为 $1 - q - pq = p(1 - q) = p^2$：", "$G_T(1) = 1$，即游戏几乎必然结束（正如", "\\cref{exo:b2:proba:6}用递推所证）。在 $1$ 处取对数求导：", "$\\E(T) = 2 - \\frac{D'(1)}{D(1)}$，其中", "$D(t) = 1 - qt - pqt^2$，$D'(1) = -q - 2pq$：", "\\[", "\\E(T) = 2 + \\frac{q + 2pq}{p^2} = \\frac{2p^2 + q + 2pq}{p^2}", "= \\frac{1 + p}{p^2},", "\\]", "它等于 $6$，此时 $p = \\frac12$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{pb:b2:genfun:1}", "\\textbf{1.} 对 $t \\in \\intoo01$，由 $G_n = G", "\\circ G_{n-1}$ 的链式法则得 $G_n'(t) =", "G'\\bigl(G_{n-1}(t)\\bigr)G_{n-1}'(t)$。当 $t \\to 1^-$ 时，", "$G_{n-1}(t) \\uparrow 1$，$G'$ 非减，", "且其左极限为 $m$（在 $1$ 处），故第一个因子趋于 $m$。", "用归纳法得第二个因子趋于 $m^{n-1}$。由", "\\cref{thm:b2:genfun:moments}可知 $\\E(Z_n) = G_n'(1^-) = m^n$。", "", "\\textbf{2.} 再求一次导数，", "\\[", "G_n'' = G''(G_{n-1})\\,(G_{n-1}')^2 +", "G'(G_{n-1})\\,G_{n-1}'',", "\\]", "令 $t \\to 1^-$，得 $a_n = G''(1)m^{2(n-1)} + m\\,", "a_{n-1}$，其中 $a_n = G_n''(1)$，$a_1 = G''(1)$。对 $m \\neq", "1$ 时，由归纳可验证 $a_n = G''(1)\\,m^{n-1}", "\\frac{m^n - 1}{m - 1}$（递推式即将 $G''(1)m^{2n-2}$", "加到 $m\\cdot G''(1)m^{n-2}\\frac{m^{n-1}-1}{m-1}$上，且", "$m^{n-1} + \\frac{m^{n-1}-1}{m-1} = \\frac{m^n - 1}{m-1}$）；", "当 $m = 1$ 时，$a_n = a_{n-1} + G''(1) = n\\,G''(1)$。", "", "\\textbf{3.} $V(Z_n) = a_n + m^n - m^{2n}$，且 $G''(1) =", "\\sigma^2 + m^2 - m$。当 $m \\neq 1$ 时，项 $(m^2 -", "m)m^{n-1}\\frac{m^n-1}{m-1} = m^n(m^n - 1)$ 恰与 $m^n -", "m^{2n}$ 相抵，剩下 $V(Z_n) =", "\\sigma^2m^{n-1}\\frac{m^n-1}{m-1}$。当 $m = 1$ 时，$V(Z_n) =", "nG''(1) = n\\sigma^2$。", "", "\\textbf{4.} $Z_n$ 是非负整数值随机变量，故", "$\\P(Z_n > 0) = \\P(Z_n \\geq 1) \\leq \\E(Z_n) = m^n$，由马尔可夫", "不等式（\\cref{thm:b2:randomvar:markov}）。当 $m < 1$ 时，此概率", "几何衰减——而且可和，故由博雷尔–坎泰利引理甚至可得", "仅有有限多个世代非空，", "这正是灭绝。", "", "\\textbf{5.} 柯西–施瓦茨不等式：$\\E(Z_n)^2 = \\E(Z_n\\mathbf", "1_{Z_n>0})^2 \\leq \\E(Z_n^2)\\,\\P(Z_n > 0)$。结合第 3 问", "及 $m < 1$：", "\\[", "\\E(Z_n^2) = V(Z_n) + m^{2n}", "\\leq \\frac{\\sigma^2m^{n-1}}{1-m} + m^{2n},", "\\]", "于是，将 $m^{2n}$ 除以该上界，并约去", "$m^n$，得", "\\[", "\\P(Z_n > 0) \\geq \\frac{m^n}{\\frac{\\sigma^2}{m(1-m)} + m^n}", "\\geq \\Bigl(\\frac{\\sigma^2}{m(1-m)} + 1\\Bigr)^{-1}m^n ,", "\\]", "利用分母中的 $m^n \\leq 1$。结合第 4 问，", "$\\P(Z_n > 0) \\asymp m^n$。", "", "\\textbf{6.} $G(t) = q\\sum_k(pt)^k = \\frac{q}{1 - pt}$，且 $m", "= G'(1) = \\frac{pq}{(1-p)^2} = \\frac pq$。当 $p", "< \\frac12$ 时为次临界，$p = \\frac12$ 时为临界，$p", "> \\frac12$ 时为超临界。", "", "\\textbf{7.} 方程 $G(t) = t$ 即 $pt^2 - t + q = 0$，其根为", "$\\frac{1 \\pm \\abs{p - q}}{2p}$，即 $1$ 与 $\\frac qp =", "\\frac1m$。灭绝概率是", "$\\intcc01$ 中最小的不动点（\\cref{thm:b2:genfun:extinction}）：", "$q_{\\mathrm{ext}} = 1$，若 $m \\leq 1$；$\\frac1m$，若 $m >", "1$。", "", "\\textbf{8.} 对 $m \\neq 1$，取 $p = \\frac m{m+1}$，$q =", "\\frac1{m+1}$。若 $q_n = \\frac{m^n - 1}{m^{n+1} - 1}$，则", "\\[", "1 - p\\,q_n = \\frac{(m+1)(m^{n+1} - 1) - m(m^n - 1)}", "{(m+1)(m^{n+1} - 1)} = \\frac{m^{n+2} - 1}{(m+1)(m^{n+1} -", "1)},", "\\]", "于是 $q_{n+1} = \\frac{q}{1 - pq_n} = \\frac{m^{n+1} -", "1}{m^{n+2} - 1}$，归纳基础 $q_0 = 0$ 成立。当 $m = 1$ 时：", "$G(t) = \\frac1{2 - t}$，且 $q_{n+1} = \\frac1{2 -", "\\frac{n}{n+1}} = \\frac{n+1}{n+2}$，$q_0 = 0$。", "", "\\textbf{9.} $1 - q_n = \\frac{m^n(m - 1)}{m^{n+1} - 1}$。当", "$m < 1$ 时，分母趋于 $-1$，故 $1 - q_n \\sim (1 -", "m)\\,m^n$。当 $m > 1$ 时：", "\\[", "q_{\\mathrm{ext}} - q_n = \\frac1m - \\frac{m^n - 1}{m^{n+1} -", "1} = \\frac{m - 1}{m\\,(m^{n+1} - 1)} \\sim \\frac{m -", "1}{m^{2}}\\;m^{-n} .", "\\]", "又 $G'(t) = \\frac{pq}{(1 - pt)^2}$ 在 $t = \\frac", "qp$ 处（此时 $1 - pt = 1 - q = p$）取值为 $G'(q_{\\mathrm{ext}})", "= \\frac qp = \\frac1m$，即所观察到的比值 $m^{-1}$ 恰为", "吸引不动点处的导数。", ""]}